  "url": "https://www.creativefabrica.com/product/bigboys/",
  "description": "Immerse yourself in the dynamic, vibrant world of street art with Bigboys, a 3D graffiti font that’s unapologetically bold and chunky. Esteemed for its distinctive trifecta of layers – solid, inner shadow, and extrude – Bigboys has the exceptional ability to imbue depth and dimension into any design. Its perfect incorporation into urban aesthetics, hip-hop posters, trendsetting streetwear logos, music album art or any other graffiti-infused endeavor is simply seamless. Boasting robust, rounded letters, layered with unique effects, Bigboys emits surges of energy and characteristic flair into a design. Irrespective of your vision – whether it’s jovial, audacious, rebellious or anything in between, this audacious font punctuates any text with a bold, street-art expression that simply refuses to blend into the background.",
  "fullDescription": "<p>Immerse yourself in the dynamic, vibrant world of street art with Bigboys, a 3D graffiti font that’s unapologetically bold and chunky. Esteemed for its distinctive trifecta of layers – solid, inner shadow, and extrude – Bigboys has the exceptional ability to imbue depth and dimension into any design. Its perfect incorporation into urban aesthetics, hip-hop posters, trendsetting streetwear logos, music album art or any other graffiti-infused endeavor is simply seamless. Boasting robust, rounded letters, layered with unique effects, Bigboys emits surges of energy and characteristic flair into a design. Irrespective of your vision – whether it’s jovial, audacious, rebellious or anything in between, this audacious font punctuates any text with a bold, street-art expression that simply refuses to blend into the background.</p>",
